e('invasivemole','Invasive hydatidiform mole',G,'An invasive mole is a gestational genomic disorder.',o='Typical complete-mole background — androgenetic diploidy|Partial-mole background — usually diandric triploidy',p='Included as invasive gestational trophoblastic neoplasia. Noninvasive moles are excluded; ploidy is not a focal CNV driver.',refs='gyn')
