e('nut','NUT carcinoma',N,'NUT carcinoma → NUTM1 rearrangement.',r='Defining — BRD4::NUTM1; BRD3::NUTM1, NSD3::NUTM1 and alternative partners',p='Can arise in thorax or head/neck; NUTM1 fusions also occur in other lineages, so fusion partner and morphology matter.',refs='hn sal',aliases='thoracic NUT carcinoma;NUT midline carcinoma')
