e('hnnet','Neuroendocrine tumor of head and neck',N,'Well-differentiated NETs have sparse site-specific driver data.',p='Includes laryngeal and middle-ear NETs; do not automatically assign the TP53/RB1 pattern of high-grade NEC.',refs='hn',aliases='middle ear neuroendocrine tumor;laryngeal carcinoid')
