('salacc','Adenoid cystic carcinoma of salivary gland','Adenoid cystic → MYB/MYBL1.','Progression subset — NOTCH1 activation','','Driver — MYB::NFIB; MYBL1::NFIB and alternative MYB/MYBL1 rearrangements','Includes salivary/lacrimal analogues; no fusion is universal.','sal'),
('salmec','Mucoepidermoid carcinoma of salivary gland','Mucoepidermoid → CRTC1/3::MAML2.','','','Characteristic — CRTC1::MAML2 or CRTC3::MAML2','Fusion-negative cases occur, especially in high-grade differential diagnoses.','sal'),
('salsecret','Secretory carcinoma of salivary gland','Secretory → ETV6::NTRK3.','','','Characteristic — ETV6::NTRK3; alternative RET/MET-related fusions in small subsets','Same canonical fusion can appear in several distinct organs/lineages.','sal'),
