('salclear','Hyalinizing clear cell carcinoma of salivary gland','Hyalinizing clear cell → EWSR1::ATF1.','','','Characteristic — EWSR1::ATF1; EWSR1::CREM alternatives','Distinct from melanoma-lineage clear cell sarcoma despite shared fusion partners.','sal'),
('salduct','Salivary duct carcinoma','Salivary duct → ERBB2 or RAS/PI3K subsets.','Recurrent — TP53, HRAS, PIK3CA, PTEN','Subset — ERBB2 amplification','','AR protein expression is common but is not itself an AR DNA alteration.','sal'),
('salemc','Epithelial-myoepithelial carcinoma','Biphasic salivary tumor → HRAS in a subset.','Driver — HRAS, often codon 61','','','Absence of HRAS does not exclude the entity.','sal'),
